WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
CITI-FX: Hi, this is the CITI FX desk, trying to reach Renata about a EUR/USD block.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
OPS: She stepped away from her desk a few minutes ago. Can I take a message?

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
CITI-FX: Sure. We are working a two hundred fifty million EUR/USD order into today's WM fix.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
CITI-FX: The client wants an indication of her axe before the fix window opens at fifteen hundred London.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
OPS: Understood. Two hundred fifty million EUR/USD, need her axe before fifteen hundred London. I will pass it on.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
CITI-FX: Mid is trading around one point zero nine one zero right now, we could show a couple pips either side on size.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
OPS: Noted. Anything else I should flag for her?

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
CITI-FX: Just that this is time sensitive, the client is patient but the fix window is not.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
OPS: I will make sure she calls you back as soon as she is free.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
CITI-FX: Appreciate it. This is the second time we have tried this morning.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
OPS: I see the earlier note in the log, apologies, she has been pulled into a risk meeting.

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
CITI-FX: No problem, we just do not want this to slip past the fix.

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
OPS: Understood, flagging this as high priority on her callback list.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
CITI-FX: One more thing, if she is not back in twenty minutes we may need to loop in someone else on the desk.

15
00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:00.000
OPS: That is fair, I will let the desk head know as a backup contact.

16
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:20.000
CITI-FX: Also worth mentioning, the client's fill deadline is firm, no extension expected from their side.

17
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:40.000
OPS: Got it, I will note the deadline is firm, no extension.

18
00:05:40.000 --> 00:06:00.000
CITI-FX: Do you know roughly when she went into the risk meeting?

19
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:20.000
OPS: About fifteen minutes ago, those usually run thirty to forty five minutes.

20
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:40.000
CITI-FX: Okay, so we might still catch her before the fix if she calls back within the hour.

21
00:06:40.000 --> 00:07:00.000
OPS: That is the plan on our side, I will chase it the moment she is back.

22
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:20.000
CITI-FX: Great, thank you for the help.

23
00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:40.000
OPS: Thank you for your patience, we will get back to you shortly.

24
00:07:40.000 --> 00:08:00.000
CITI-FX: Talk soon.
